        <initializer>= &quot;fail_closed&quot;</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Escape valve strategy when quality check times out. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Determines what action to take when a quality check times out:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;fail_closed&quot;: Reject the document (fail-safe behavior)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;fail_open&quot;: Accept the document anyway</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;defer&quot;: Defer quality check to a later batch (accumulate and retry) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
